{"id":"vol9-05","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-05/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":373.45,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.06,"text":"You have some time to look at questions 31 to 40.","words":[["You",0.0,0.12],["have",0.12,0.28],["some",0.28,0.44],["time",0.44,0.8],["to",0.8,1.06],["look",1.06,1.2],["at",1.2,1.3],["questions",1.3,1.64],["31",1.64,2.46],["to",2.46,2.72],["40.",2.72,3.06]]},{"start":53.74,"end":57.4,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",53.74,54.04],["listen",54.04,54.36],["carefully",54.36,54.78],["and",54.78,55.14],["answer",55.14,55.52],["questions",55.52,55.92],["31",55.92,56.78],["to",56.78,57.08],["40.",57.08,57.4]]},{"start":60.71,"end":61.63,"text":"Hi everyone.","words":[["Hi",60.71,61.31],["everyone.",61.31,61.63]]},{"start":62.41,"end":64.15,"text":"I've just returned from my field trip","words":[["I've",62.41,62.59],["just",62.59,62.83],["returned",62.83,63.23],["from",63.23,63.41],["my",63.41,63.57],["field",63.57,63.85],["trip",63.85,64.15]]},{"start":64.15,"end":66.73,"text":"and want to share some of my experiences with you.","words":[["and",64.15,64.65],["want",64.65,64.79],["to",64.79,64.95],["share",64.95,65.13],["some",65.13,65.35],["of",65.35,65.47],["my",65.47,65.61],["experiences",65.61,66.19],["with",66.19,66.51],["you.",66.51,66.73]]},{"start":67.57,"end":70.29,"text":"I learned a lot about whale sharks on this trip.","words":[["I",67.57,68.13],["learned",68.13,68.37],["a",68.37,68.63],["lot",68.63,68.87],["about",68.87,69.13],["whale",69.13,69.35],["sharks",69.35,69.63],["on",69.63,69.87],["this",69.87,70.03],["trip.",70.03,70.29]]},{"start":70.85,"end":74.17,"text":"For example, they're actually the largest species of fish","words":[["For",70.85,71.01],["example,",71.01,71.37],["they're",71.71,72.03],["actually",72.03,72.41],["the",72.41,72.69],["largest",72.69,73.13],["species",73.13,73.53],["of",73.53,73.85],["fish",73.85,74.17]]},{"start":74.17,"end":76.77,"text":"in the world seas, about the size of a bus.","words":[["in",74.17,74.47],["the",74.47,74.55],["world",74.55,74.77],["seas,",74.77,75.19],["about",75.51,75.97],["the",75.97,76.15],["size",76.15,76.35],["of",76.35,76.49],["a",76.49,76.59],["bus.",76.59,76.77]]},{"start":77.73,"end":79.07,"text":"Despite their massive size,","words":[["Despite",77.73,78.09],["their",78.09,78.35],["massive",78.35,78.63],["size,",78.63,79.07]]},{"start":79.67,"end":81.45,"text":"whale sharks are docile animals.","words":[["whale",79.67,79.79],["sharks",79.79,80.19],["are",80.19,80.55],["docile",80.55,81.01],["animals.",81.01,81.45]]},{"start":82.83,"end":84.85,"text":"Because of the name, you might be confused","words":[["Because",82.83,83.07],["of",83.07,83.23],["the",83.23,83.35],["name,",83.35,83.65],["you",83.93,84.13],["might",84.13,84.33],["be",84.33,84.49],["confused",84.49,84.85]]},{"start":84.85,"end":87.53,"text":"about whether these animals are whales or sharks.","words":[["about",84.85,85.13],["whether",85.13,85.39],["these",85.39,85.63],["animals",85.63,85.99],["are",85.99,86.33],["whales",86.33,86.57],["or",86.57,87.19],["sharks.",87.19,87.53]]},{"start":88.67,"end":90.23,"text":"They are in fact sharks,","words":[["They",88.67,88.81],["are",88.81,89.11],["in",89.11,89.23],["fact",89.23,89.55],["sharks,",89.55,90.23]]},{"start":90.95,"end":93.69,"text":"but they do have some things in common with whales.","words":[["but",90.95,91.27],["they",91.27,91.85],["do",91.85,92.05],["have",92.05,92.27],["some",92.27,92.49],["things",92.49,92.73],["in",92.73,92.89],["common",92.89,93.13],["with",93.13,93.31],["whales.",93.31,93.69]]},{"start":94.43,"end":96.85,"text":"They're similar in terms of their large size","words":[["They're",94.43,94.97],["similar",94.97,95.27],["in",95.27,95.65],["terms",95.65,95.89],["of",95.89,96.07],["their",96.07,96.19],["large",96.19,96.47],["size",96.47,96.85]]},{"start":96.85,"end":98.11,"text":"and what they eat.","words":[["and",96.85,97.43],["what",97.43,97.57],["they",97.57,97.75],["eat.",97.75,98.11]]},{"start":98.91,"end":100.33,"text":"Like many species of whales,","words":[["Like",98.91,99.03],["many",99.03,99.37],["species",99.37,99.69],["of",99.69,99.95],["whales,",99.95,100.33]]},{"start":100.85,"end":103.55,"text":"their diet consists mainly of plankton and krill,","words":[["their",100.85,100.95],["diet",100.95,101.25],["consists",101.25,101.67],["mainly",101.67,102.19],["of",102.19,102.45],["plankton",102.45,102.91],["and",102.91,103.17],["krill,",103.17,103.55]]},{"start":104.03,"end":105.75,"text":"which are tiny plants and animals.","words":[["which",104.03,104.33],["are",104.33,104.49],["tiny",104.49,104.85],["plants",104.85,105.21],["and",105.21,105.43],["animals.",105.43,105.75]]},{"start":106.99,"end":108.79,"text":"Unlike many whale species,","words":[["Unlike",106.99,107.59],["many",107.59,108.05],["whale",108.05,108.35],["species,",108.35,108.79]]},{"start":109.27,"end":111.67,"text":"they prefer to swim close to the surface of the water","words":[["they",109.27,109.43],["prefer",109.43,109.71],["to",109.71,109.93],["swim",109.93,110.15],["close",110.15,110.47],["to",110.47,110.69],["the",110.69,110.79],["surface",110.79,111.09],["of",111.09,111.29],["the",111.29,111.39],["water",111.39,111.67]]},{"start":111.67,"end":114.07,"text":"rather than cruising the depths of the ocean.","words":[["rather",111.67,112.39],["than",112.39,112.65],["cruising",112.65,113.01],["the",113.01,113.27],["depths",113.27,113.51],["of",113.51,113.69],["the",113.69,113.79],["ocean.",113.79,114.07]]},{"start":114.91,"end":117.45,"text":"So that's a key difference relating to their habits.","words":[["So",114.91,115.15],["that's",115.15,115.53],["a",115.53,115.65],["key",115.65,115.91],["difference",115.91,116.33],["relating",116.33,116.71],["to",116.71,116.99],["their",116.99,117.13],["habits.",117.13,117.45]]},{"start":118.33,"end":120.51,"text":"Another one relates to their physical makeup.","words":[["Another",118.33,118.71],["one",118.71,119.03],["relates",119.03,119.47],["to",119.47,119.67],["their",119.67,119.81],["physical",119.81,120.11],["makeup.",120.11,120.51]]},{"start":121.39,"end":124.31,"text":"Their skeleton is made entirely of cartilage","words":[["Their",121.39,121.53],["skeleton",121.53,121.89],["is",121.89,122.33],["made",122.33,122.53],["entirely",122.53,123.33],["of",123.33,123.65],["cartilage",123.65,124.31]]},{"start":124.6,"end":126.11,"text":"in comparison to whales","words":[["in",124.6,124.91],["comparison",124.91,125.23],["to",125.23,125.73],["whales",125.73,126.11]]},{"start":126.11,"end":128.55,"text":"that have skeletons made of real bones.","words":[["that",126.11,126.57],["have",126.57,126.73],["skeletons",126.73,127.19],["made",127.19,127.65],["of",127.65,127.81],["real",127.81,128.03],["bones.",128.03,128.55]]},{"start":129.45,"end":133.31,"text":"The place I visited is called Ningaloo in Western Australia.","words":[["The",129.45,129.99],["place",129.99,130.19],["I",130.19,130.51],["visited",130.51,130.79],["is",130.79,131.29],["called",131.29,131.51],["Ningaloo",131.51,132.21],["in",132.21,132.59],["Western",132.59,132.87],["Australia.",132.87,133.31]]},{"start":134.05,"end":136.89,"text":"We were there to observe a large group of whale sharks","words":[["We",134.05,134.33],["were",134.33,134.45],["there",134.45,134.63],["to",134.63,134.83],["observe",134.83,135.21],["a",135.21,135.47],["large",135.47,135.77],["group",135.77,135.99],["of",135.99,136.23],["whale",136.23,136.47],["sharks",136.47,136.89]]},{"start":136.89,"end":139.13,"text":"which congregate in that part of the ocean","words":[["which",136.89,137.47],["congregate",137.47,138.09],["in",138.09,138.25],["that",138.25,138.41],["part",138.41,138.65],["of",138.65,138.75],["the",138.75,138.85],["ocean",138.85,139.13]]},{"start":139.13,"end":141.57,"text":"each year between April and July.","words":[["each",139.13,139.57],["year",139.57,139.93],["between",139.93,140.23],["April",140.23,140.71],["and",140.71,141.23],["July.",141.23,141.57]]},{"start":142.53,"end":144.73,"text":"Ninkaloo is ideal for whale sharks","words":[["Ninkaloo",142.53,143.17],["is",143.17,143.41],["ideal",143.41,143.95],["for",143.95,144.23],["whale",144.23,144.43],["sharks",144.43,144.73]]},{"start":144.73,"end":146.79,"text":"because there is a coral reef nearby","words":[["because",144.73,145.39],["there",145.39,145.65],["is",145.65,145.79],["a",145.79,145.93],["coral",145.93,146.15],["reef",146.15,146.47],["nearby",146.47,146.79]]},{"start":146.79,"end":149.67,"text":"which ensures an abundant supply of food.","words":[["which",146.79,147.55],["ensures",147.55,147.91],["an",147.91,148.19],["abundant",148.19,148.57],["supply",148.57,149.11],["of",149.11,149.37],["food.",149.37,149.67]]},{"start":150.39,"end":151.91,"text":"It's great for divers too","words":[["It's",150.39,150.71],["great",150.71,150.89],["for",150.89,151.09],["divers",151.09,151.47],["too",151.47,151.91]]},{"start":151.91,"end":154.95,"text":"because although it's in relatively deep waters,","words":[["because",151.91,152.77],["although",152.77,153.31],["it's",153.31,153.59],["in",153.59,153.71],["relatively",153.71,154.11],["deep",154.11,154.55],["waters,",154.55,154.95]]},{"start":155.47,"end":157.99,"text":"the reef is in close proximity to the shore.","words":[["the",155.47,155.67],["reef",155.67,155.91],["is",155.91,156.23],["in",156.23,156.35],["close",156.35,156.67],["proximity",156.67,157.21],["to",157.21,157.55],["the",157.55,157.67],["shore.",157.67,157.99]]},{"start":158.65,"end":161.61,"text":"Unlike some reefs that you have to travel miles to get to.","words":[["Unlike",158.65,159.01],["some",159.01,159.41],["reefs",159.41,159.73],["that",159.73,159.95],["you",159.95,160.05],["have",160.05,160.17],["to",160.17,160.31],["travel",160.31,160.55],["miles",160.55,160.93],["to",160.93,161.19],["get",161.19,161.35],["to.",161.35,161.61]]},{"start":163.19,"end":165.19,"text":"I'd like to move on now to tell you","words":[["I'd",163.19,163.83],["like",163.83,163.95],["to",163.95,164.11],["move",164.11,164.27],["on",164.27,164.43],["now",164.43,164.73],["to",164.73,164.91],["tell",164.91,165.07],["you",165.07,165.19]]},{"start":165.19,"end":167.01,"text":"about the Whale Shark Research Centre","words":[["about",165.19,165.41],["the",165.41,165.57],["Whale",165.57,165.77],["Shark",165.77,166.09],["Research",166.09,166.47],["Centre",166.47,167.01]]},{"start":167.01,"end":172.39,"text":"and the research being conducted there. We know that whale sharks are migratory,","words":[["and",167.01,167.61],["the",167.61,167.71],["research",167.71,168.09],["being",168.09,168.41],["conducted",168.41,168.85],["there.",168.85,169.15],["We",170.03,170.25],["know",170.25,170.53],["that",170.53,170.83],["whale",170.83,171.07],["sharks",171.07,171.37],["are",171.37,171.69],["migratory,",171.69,172.39]]},{"start":172.79,"end":178.01,"text":"but not a lot is known about where they go and why. The methods currently being","words":[["but",172.79,173.23],["not",173.23,173.53],["a",173.53,173.63],["lot",173.63,173.71],["is",173.71,173.89],["known",173.89,174.07],["about",174.07,174.35],["where",174.35,174.69],["they",174.69,174.87],["go",174.87,175.09],["and",175.09,175.49],["why.",175.49,175.79],["The",176.69,176.91],["methods",176.91,177.17],["currently",177.17,177.69],["being",177.69,178.01]]},{"start":178.01,"end":183.43,"text":"used to monitor them could be better. One way is to use an electronic tracking","words":[["used",178.01,178.33],["to",178.33,178.51],["monitor",178.51,178.73],["them",178.73,179.09],["could",179.09,179.61],["be",179.61,179.81],["better.",179.81,180.11],["One",181.03,181.29],["way",181.29,181.55],["is",181.55,181.91],["to",181.91,182.05],["use",182.05,182.31],["an",182.31,182.53],["electronic",182.53,182.97],["tracking",182.97,183.43]]},{"start":183.43,"end":189.53,"text":"device or TAG, which researchers have to attach manually to the fin. It's not an","words":[["device",183.43,183.79],["or",183.79,184.15],["TAG,",184.15,184.65],["which",184.99,185.29],["researchers",185.29,185.79],["have",185.79,186.11],["to",186.11,186.29],["attach",186.29,186.57],["manually",186.57,187.05],["to",187.05,187.47],["the",187.47,187.57],["fin.",187.57,187.83],["It's",188.61,188.91],["not",188.91,189.21],["an",189.21,189.53]]},{"start":189.53,"end":195.21,"text":"easy process and the tags are also quite expensive so if it falls off you're","words":[["easy",189.53,189.73],["process",189.73,190.17],["and",190.17,190.89],["the",190.89,190.99],["tags",190.99,191.35],["are",191.35,191.53],["also",191.53,191.89],["quite",191.89,192.25],["expensive",192.25,192.87],["so",192.87,193.77],["if",193.77,193.95],["it",193.95,194.09],["falls",194.09,194.25],["off",194.25,194.71],["you're",194.71,195.21]]},{"start":195.21,"end":201.05,"text":"trouble. Another way of monitoring whale sharks is with a special drone to spot","words":[["trouble.",195.21,195.59],["Another",196.49,196.85],["way",196.85,197.23],["of",197.23,197.41],["monitoring",197.41,197.85],["whale",197.85,198.19],["sharks",198.19,198.55],["is",198.55,199.07],["with",199.07,199.21],["a",199.21,199.33],["special",199.33,199.73],["drone",199.73,200.31],["to",200.31,200.81],["spot",200.81,201.05]]},{"start":201.05,"end":206.17,"text":"the animals in the ocean. This can give you a rough idea of numbers but obviously","words":[["the",201.05,201.23],["animals",201.23,201.57],["in",201.57,201.87],["the",201.87,202.01],["ocean.",202.01,202.27],["This",203.01,203.23],["can",203.23,203.41],["give",203.41,203.57],["you",203.57,203.71],["a",203.71,203.79],["rough",203.79,204.03],["idea",204.03,204.31],["of",204.31,204.45],["numbers",204.45,204.79],["but",204.79,205.29],["obviously",205.29,206.17]]},{"start":206.17,"end":212.57,"text":"it's not an exact science. The researchers at Ningaloo are involved in a","words":[["it's",206.17,206.65],["not",206.65,206.93],["an",206.93,207.21],["exact",207.21,207.43],["science.",207.43,207.99],["The",209.63,210.27],["researchers",210.27,210.77],["at",210.77,211.05],["Ningaloo",211.05,211.53],["are",211.53,211.83],["involved",211.83,212.15],["in",212.15,212.47],["a",212.47,212.57]]},{"start":212.57,"end":216.51,"text":"new research project that's currently being carried out to investigate whale","words":[["new",212.57,212.75],["research",212.75,213.17],["project",213.17,213.63],["that's",213.63,214.25],["currently",214.25,214.55],["being",214.55,214.87],["carried",214.87,215.19],["out",215.19,215.45],["to",215.45,215.65],["investigate",215.65,216.03],["whale",216.03,216.51]]},{"start":216.51,"end":221.37,"text":"shark feeding habits. They hope to find out more about how far whale sharks","words":[["shark",216.51,216.91],["feeding",216.91,217.31],["habits.",217.31,217.75],["They",218.51,218.77],["hope",218.77,219.03],["to",219.03,219.23],["find",219.23,219.43],["out",219.43,219.67],["more",219.67,219.89],["about",219.89,220.15],["how",220.15,220.39],["far",220.39,220.75],["whale",220.75,221.05],["sharks",221.05,221.37]]},{"start":221.37,"end":226.05,"text":"travel to feed. They're using an innovative approach to do this which","words":[["travel",221.37,221.75],["to",221.75,222.01],["feed.",222.01,222.31],["They're",223.21,223.45],["using",223.45,223.73],["an",223.73,223.93],["innovative",223.93,224.43],["approach",224.43,224.89],["to",224.89,225.13],["do",225.13,225.33],["this",225.33,225.63],["which",225.63,226.05]]},{"start":226.05,"end":231.57,"text":"analyzes plankton. Apparently plankton from different places contains different","words":[["analyzes",226.05,226.71],["plankton.",226.71,227.29],["Apparently",228.03,228.55],["plankton",228.55,229.49],["from",229.49,229.67],["different",229.67,229.99],["places",229.99,230.45],["contains",230.45,231.13],["different",231.13,231.57]]},{"start":231.57,"end":235.97,"text":"quantities of carbon types. The researchers are checking the plankton","words":[["quantities",231.57,232.17],